msgstr "रीप्ले गेन मोड चुनें"

#: src/libvlc-module.c:239
msgid "Replay preamp"
msgstr "रीप्ले प्रिऐम्प"

#: src/libvlc-module.c:241
msgid ""
"This allows you to change the default target level (89 dB) for stream with "
"replay gain information"
msgstr ""
"यह आपको फिर से खेलना लाभ जानकारी के साथ धारा के लिए तयशुदा लक्ष्य स्तर (89 DB) बदलने "
"के लिए अनुमति देता है"

#: src/libvlc-module.c:244
msgid "Default replay gain"
msgstr "डिफ़ॉल्ट रीप्ले गेन"

#: src/libvlc-module.c:246
msgid "This is the gain used for stream without replay gain information"
msgstr "यह फिर से खेलना लाभ जानकारी के बिना धारा के लिए इस्तेमाल किया हासिल है"

#: src/libvlc-module.c:248
msgid "Peak protection"
msgstr "पीक संरक्षण"

#: src/libvlc-module.c:250
msgid "Protect against sound clipping"
msgstr "ध्वनि क्लिपिंग के खिलाफ की रक्षा"

#: src/libvlc-module.c:253
msgid "Drift readings needed before correcting audibly"
msgstr ""

#: src/libvlc-module.c:255
msgid ""
"Flushing the audio output or padding it with silence is audible, and a "
"single late measurement -- one scheduling hiccup -- used to be enough to "
"trigger it. Require this many consecutive measurements instead. Set to 1 for "
"the historical behaviour."
msgstr ""

#: src/libvlc-module.c:261
msgid "Correct audio drift by inserting silence"
msgstr ""

#: src/libvlc-module.c:263
msgid ""
"When the audio output has drifted ahead of the input clock, it can be padded "
"with silence to realign. That keeps audio in step with video, at the cost of "
"an audible gap; letting the resampler absorb the offset instead is inaudible "
"but slow, and leaves audio slightly ahead until it catches up. By default "
"this is decided per stream: padding is used only when there is video or a "
"stream output to stay in step with."
msgstr ""

#: src/libvlc-module.c:272
msgid "Never (resample instead)"
msgstr ""

#: src/libvlc-module.c:272
msgid "Only when there is video"
msgstr ""

